Subject: [PATCH 35/56] Guide: Change Personal Picture; no Take Personal
 Picture without a camera

Edit Gamer Picture's Change Personal Picture (PressPath
ChangePersonalTile.xur) is the same picture grid as Change Gamer Picture
(list filler 90117E80), focus previewing on the card. A writes the
personal picture (90105990, XamWriteGamerTileEx type 2: the gamercard's
personal picture key) and goes back.

807's init (90106030) unlinks Take Personal Picture unless a Vision
camera was ever connected (XCONFIG_CONSOLE_CAMERA_SETTINGS 0x4000) or is
now (XUsbcamGetState), so this console's Edit Gamer Picture has three
buttons.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
